arbeitnow:staff-software-engineer-contex:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI's operational blind spots into operational clarity. World's leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there's a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Celonis Context Model&lt;/strong&gt; provides a real-time digital twin of enterprise operations, serving as the bridge between enterprise systems and AI. It captures how business actually flows across systems, giving organizations and AI agents the context needed to optimize complex workflows in real time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an engineer on the Context Model Core team, you will shape the foundation powering the future of Enterprise AI and Process Intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are looking for a Full Stack Engineer to build the core capabilities to power the Celonis Context Model. In this role, you will build the next generation of user-facing tools and robust backend services that define how the world’s largest enterprises understand their data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will tackle full-stack engineering challenges end-to-end: from designing scalable microservices in &lt;strong&gt;Java (Spring Boot)&lt;/strong&gt; to building rich, interactive UI components in &lt;strong&gt;Angular and TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ll work closely with product and design to turn abstract data modeling into fast, reliable and joyful user experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work at Celonis will directly impact companies and people around the globe as they improve their processes to save money, reduce waste, improve automation and generally become more efficient.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, articulate and drive the execution of the technical vision and strategy for the entire product area, securing necessary buy-in from stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain hands-on, leading the development of complex, critical-path components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving application performance improvement for big data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play an active role in product discussions to shape roadmaps, ensuring technical feasibility aligns with business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set an example for technical excellence through rigorous design reviews, setting high coding standards, and taking action to improve developer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and grow teammates while helping to define a fun and inclusive engineering culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The product you’ll work on:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the next generation of process mining by developing core platform capabilities that power the Celonis Context Model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable customers to model business processes as they operate in reality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add semantic meaning to business data and make it efficiently queryable&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with AI/ML teams to simplify and accelerate context modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable connected, enterprise-wide process insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you’ll typically need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of product development experience with strong track record of technical leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience in architecting complex, distributed systems with large-scale data performance challenges.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in consistently delivering high-quality output and elevating the performance and quality standards of the broader team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take vague product requirements and turn them into concrete, executable technical roadmaps.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills to gather alignment among diverse stakeholders and explain complex technical concepts to non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred experience:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Angular TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Java Spring Boot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class="p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested" data-stringify-type="unordered-list" data-list-tree="true" data-indent="0" data-border="0"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time "Celonaut" is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated "Wellness Weeks" that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="1264"&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="1982"&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class="_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe" data-renderer-mark="true" data-is-router-link="false" data-testid="link-with-safety"&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that's when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href="https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices"&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href="https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/"&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href="https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:national-account-manager-retai:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role: National Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Area / Brand: Retail \ Myprotien&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to: B2B Sales Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: THG ICON 1, 7-9 Sunbank Lane, WA15 0AF (Hybrid)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at THG Nutrition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="353" data-end="578"&gt;THG Nutrition is home to some of the world’s most trusted and best-loved wellbeing and nutrition brands, including Myprotein, the world’s largest online sports nutrition brand, alongside Myvegan, Myvitamins and MP Activewear.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="580" data-end="776"&gt;Our brands and people exist to break boundaries — to power and empower those who want more. We move fast, challenge convention, and back ourselves to win. These values shape how we work every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;We are seeking an ambitious and commercially focused National Account Manager to drive growth across the Retail and Grocery channel. This role will be responsible for managing key national retail accounts, developing strategic customer partnerships, and delivering sustainable sales and profit growth across major grocery retailers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;The successful candidate will have strong FMCG experience, exceptional relationship management skills, and a proven ability to execute commercial plans within a fast-paced retail environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread="false"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and develop relationships with key Grocery and Retail customers across the UK market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver sales, margin, and distribution targets in line with annual business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and execute Joint Business Plans (JBPs) to support long-term customer growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead commercial negotiations including pricing, promotional activity, range reviews, and new product listings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to grow category performance, increase market share, and improve customer profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with marketing, category, supply chain, finance, and demand planning teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse customer performance, market trends, and competitor activity to inform commercial strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage forecasting, promotional planning, and account performance reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
